>\n                                        1 / 3\n                                    </b>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div aria-label=\"1 green, 1 yellow, 1 red of 3 stops\" class=\"tempo-mobile-meter\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-2-3-3\" data-name=\"mobile distribution meter bar\">\n                                <span class=\"g\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-2-3-3-1\" data-name=\"mobile green meter segment\" style=\"width:33.33%\">\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"y\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-2-3-3-2\" data-name=\"mobile yellow meter segment\" style=\"width:33.33%\">\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"r\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-2-3-3-3\" data-name=\"mobile red meter segment\" style=\"width:33.34%\">\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"tempo-table-foot\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3\" data-name=\"table footer disclaimer row\">\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3-1\" data-name=\"table footer left note text\">\n                        Counts are demo scenario values, not a live fleet reading.\n                    </span>\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3-2\" data-name=\"table footer right note container\">\n                        <strong data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"table footer right bold note\">\n                            Band thresholds are estimated model inputs.\n                        </strong>\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <div class=\"tempo-next-grid\" data-kid=\"1-2-4\" data-name=\"analytics cards grid below main table\">\n            <section aria-labelledby=\"thermal-distribution-title\" class=\"tempo-panel\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"thermal risk distribution panel\">\n                <div class=\"tempo-panel-head\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"panel header with title and data note\">\n                    <div data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-1\" data-name=\"panel title and subtitle container\">\n                        <h3 data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"panel title text\" id=\"thermal-distribution-title\">\n                            Thermal risk distribution\n                        </h3>\n                        <div class=\"sub\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"panel subtitle text\">\n                            Share of 12 route stops in this demo scenario\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tempo-data-note\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2\" data-name=\"demo data indicator note\">\n                        12 stops total\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"tempo-panel-body\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2\" data-name=\"panel body with distribution breakdown\">\n                    <div class=\"tempo-legend-head\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1\" data-name=\"legend header row with column labels\">\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"legend header label for model band\">\n                            Model band\n                        </span>\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"legend header label for stops over total\" style=\"text-align:right\">\n                            Stops / total\n                        </span>\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"legend header label for share\" style=\"text-align:right\">\n                            Share\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tempo-risk-row\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2\" data-name=\"green band risk row\">\n                        <div class=\"tempo-risk-name\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"green band name with color dot and duration\">\n                            <i class=\"green\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"green indicator dot\">\n                            </i>\n                            Green band\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"green band duration label\" style=\"color:var(--tempo-muted);font-weight:400\">\n                                > 2.5 h\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"tempo-risk-amount\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"green band stops count\">\n                            6 / 12\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"tempo-risk-share\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"green band share percentage\">\n                            50%\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"tempo-mini-bar\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2-4\" data-name=\"green band mini progress bar\">\n                            <span class=\"green\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"green mini bar fill span\">\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tempo-risk-row\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-3\" data-name=\"yellow band risk row\">\n                        <div class=\"tempo-risk-name\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"yellow band name with color dot and duration\">\n                            <i class=\"amber\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"yellow indicator dot\">\n                            </i>\n                            Yellow band\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"yellow band duration label\" style=\"color:var(--tempo-muted);font-weight:400\">\n                                0.5–2.5 h\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"tempo-risk-amount\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"yellow band stops count\">\n                            3 / 12\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"tempo-risk-share\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-3-3\" data-name=\"yellow band share percentage\">\n                            25%\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"tempo-mini-bar\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-3-4\" data-name=\"yellow band mini progress bar\">\n                            <span class=\"amber\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-3-4-1\" data-name=\"yellow mini bar fill span\" style=\"width:25%\">\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tempo-risk-row\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-4\" data-name=\"red band risk row\">\n                        <div class=\"tempo-risk-name\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"red band name with color dot and duration\">\n                            <i class=\"red\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"red indicator dot\">\n                            </i>\n                            Red band\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-4-1-2\" data-name=\"red band duration label\" style=\"color:var(--tempo-muted);font-weight:400\">\n                                < 0.5 h\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"tempo-risk-amount\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-4-2\" data-name=\"red band stops count\">\n                            3 / 12\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"tempo-risk-share\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-4-3\" data-name=\"red band share percentage\">\n                            25%\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"tempo-mini-bar\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-4-4\" data-name=\"red band mini progress bar\">\n                            <span class=\"red\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-4-4-1\" data-name=\"red mini bar fill span\" style=\"width:25%\">\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"tempo-caption\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-5\" data-name=\"thermal distribution disclaimer caption\">\n                        These bands report model output only. A green-band stop is not a guarantee of safety.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n            <section aria-labelledby=\"utilization-title\" class=\"tempo-panel\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2\" data-name=\"vehicle utilization panel\">\n                <div class=\"tempo-panel-head\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"panel header with title and data note\">\n                    <div data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"panel title and subtitle container\">\n                        <h3 data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"panel title text\" id=\"utilization-title\">\n                            Vehicle utilization\n                        </h3>\n                        <div class=\"sub\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"panel subtitle text\">\n                            Current carried volume against total fleet capacity\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tempo-data-note\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-2\" data-name=\"demo data indicator note\">\n                        Demo data\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"tempo-panel-body\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"panel body with utilization metrics\">\n                    <div class=\"tempo-capacity-top\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"capacity top row with percentage and ratio\">\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"capacity label and percentage container\">\n                            <div class=\"label\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"fleet utilization label\">\n                                Fleet utilization\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"big\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"fleet utilization percentage value\">\n                                20.2\n                                <span data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-2-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"percentage unit span\">\n                                    %\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"ratio\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"volume ratio value in monospace\">\n                            4,580 / 22,640 L\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div aria-label=\"20.2 percent capacity used\" class=\"tempo-capacity-bar\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-2-2\" data-name=\"capacity progress bar image\" role=\"img\">\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"capacity bar fill span\">\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tempo-capacity-labels\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-2-3\" data-name=\"capacity label row for current volume\">\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"current volume label\">\n                            Current volume\n                        </span>\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"current volume value\">\n                            4,580 L\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tempo-capacity-labels\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-2-4\" data-name=\"capacity label row for total capacity\">\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"total fleet capacity label\">\n                            Total fleet capacity\n                        </span>\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-2-4-2\" data-name=\"total fleet capacity value\">\n                            22,640 L\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"tempo-caption\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-2-5\" data-name=\"utilization disclaimer caption\">\n                        The ratio is calculated from the displayed demo volumes and capacities; it is not a live load estimate.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n        </div>\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"model-reference-title\" class=\"tempo-model\" data-kid=\"1-2-5\" data-name=\"model and threshold reference section\">\n            <div class=\"tempo-model-intro\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1\" data-name=\"model section intro header\">\n                <h2 data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1\" data-name=\"model section title text\" id=\"model-reference-title\">\n                    Model & threshold reference\n                </h2>\n                <p data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2\" data-name=\"model section disclaimer text\">\n                    Lower-priority reference · estimates require validation before operational use.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"tempo-model-grid\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2\" data-name=\"model reference cards grid\">\n                <div class=\"tempo-reference\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1\" data-name=\"adulteration detection thresholds card\">\n                    <h3 data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1-1\" data-name=\"thresholds card title\">\n                        Adulteration detection thresholds\n                    </h3>\n                    <p class=\"desc\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1-2\" data-name=\"thresholds card description text\">\n                        Documented demo defaults. Thresholds are estimates, not confirmed quality standards.\n                    </p>\n                    <table aria-label=\"Estimated adulteration detection thresholds\" class=\"tempo-threshold-table\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1-3\" data-name=\"adulteration thresholds data table\">\n                        <thead data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"thresholds table header\">\n                            <tr data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"thresholds table header row\">\n                                <th data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"metric column header\">\n                                    Metric\n                                </th>\n                                <th data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1-3-1-1-2\" data-name=\"estimated trigger column header\" style=\"text-align:right\">\n                                    Estimated trigger\n                                </th>\n                            </tr>\n                        </thead>\n                        <tbody data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1-3-2\" data-name=\"thresholds table body\">\n                            <tr data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"volume change threshold row\">\n                                <td data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"volume change metric name\">\n                                    Volume change\n                                </td>\n                                <td data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1-3-2-1-2\" data-name=\"volume change trigger value\">\n                                    > +2.0%\n                                </td>\n                            </tr>\n                            <tr data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"fat percentage threshold row\">\n                                <td data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"fat percentage metric name\">\n                                    Fat percentage change\n                                </td>\n                                <td data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"fat percentage trigger value\">\n                                    > 0.3% drop\n                                </td>\n                            </tr>\n                            <tr data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1-3-2-3\" data-name=\"SNF percentage threshold row\">\n                                <td data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1-3-2-3-1\" data-name=\"SNF percentage metric name\">\n                                    SNF percentage change\n                                </td>\n                                <td data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1-3-2-3-2\" data-name=\"SNF percentage trigger value\">\n                                    > 0.3% drop\n                                </td>\n                            </tr>\n                            <tr data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1-3-2-4\" data-name=\"density threshold row\">\n                                <td data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1-3-2-4-1\" data-name=\"density metric name\">\n                                    Density\n                                </td>\n                                <td data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1-3-2-4-2\" data-name=\"density trigger value\">\n                                    < 1.026 g/cm³\n                                </td>\n                            </tr>\n                        </tbody>\n                    </table>\n                    <div class=\"tempo-disclaimer\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1-4\" data-name=\"thresholds validation disclaimer\">\n                        <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-alert-triangle\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1-4-1\" data-name=\"alert triangle warning icon\">\n                        </i>\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-1-4-2\" data-name=\"thresholds disclaimer text\">\n                            Validate these estimates with cooperative and food-safety specialists before using them for intake decisions.\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"tempo-reference\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-2\" data-name=\"thermal safety buffer reference card\">\n                    <h3 data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-2-1\" data-name=\"TSB card title\">\n                        Thermal safety buffer (TSB)\n                    </h3>\n                    <p class=\"desc\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-2-2\" data-name=\"TSB card description text\">\n                        Reference formula and current dashboard model inputs.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"tempo-formula\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-2-3\" data-name=\"TSB formula code block\">\n                        TSB_hours = (θ_critical − (T_initial − T_base))\n                        <br data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"line break in formula\"/>\n                        ÷ (k × (T_ambient − T_base) × β_insulation)\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tempo-constants\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-2-4\" data-name=\"TSB constants grid\">\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"theta critical constant item\">\n                            <strong data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"theta critical symbol label\">\n                                θ_critical\n                            </strong>\n                            850 degree-hours\n                        </span>\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-2-4-2\" data-name=\"T base constant item\">\n                            <strong data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"T base symbol label\">\n                                T_base\n                            </strong>\n                            4 °C\n                        </span>\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-2-4-3\" data-name=\"k constant item\">\n                            <strong data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-2-4-3-1\" data-name=\"k symbol label\">\n                                k\n                            </strong>\n                            0.15\n                        </span>\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-2-4-4\" data-name=\"beta insulation constant item\">\n                            <strong data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-2-4-4-1\" data-name=\"beta insulation symbol label\">\n                                β_insulation\n                            </strong>\n                            0.4–1.0\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tempo-disclaimer\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-2-5\" data-name=\"TSB disclaimer note\">\n                        <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-info-circle\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-2-5-1\" data-name=\"info circle icon\">\n                        </i>\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-2-5-2-2-5-2\" data-name=\"TSB disclaimer text\">\n                            Formula coefficients and risk-band thresholds are estimated model inputs. No band guarantees a stop is safe.\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <div class=\"tempo-footer\" data-kid=\"1-2-6\" data-name=\"page footer disclaimer\">\n            All figures on this screen are illustrative and marked\n            <strong data-kid=\"1-2-6-1\" data-name=\"footer demo scenario bold label\" style=\"color:var(--tempo-muted);font-weight:600\">\n                Demo scenario · not live.\n            </strong>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n</div>\n",
      "comments": [],
      "created": "2026-10-10T03:34:12.377759+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-10-10T03:35:04.442589+00:00",
      "id": "var_d08ca00375bf",
      "contentHeight": 1761
    },
    "var_cc361d004ec6": {
      "type": "variant",
      "label": "Round-led — Dashboard",
      "parentId": null,
      "themeId": null,
      "rect": {
        "x": 12320,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 1440,
        "h": 0
      },
      "html": "<style>\n    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');\n@import url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tabler/icons-webfont@3.48.0/dist/tabler-icons.min.css');\n.tempo{--canvas:#0c0f0f;--surface:#121616;--surface-raised:#171c1b;--surface-deep:#0f1312;--line:#28302e;--line-soft:#202725;--text:#eef2ef;--muted:#9ba6a1;--quiet:#75817c;--mint:#4ce0bc;--mint-dim:#173b33;--amber:#f0bd5b;--amber-dim:#3a2d16;--red:#ff7180;--red-dim:#401e24;--blue:#91a9ff;font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;color:var(--text);background:var(--canvas);min-height:100vh;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5}\n.tempo button,.tempo select{font:inherit;color:inherit}.tempo button{cursor:pointer}.tempo *{box-sizing:border-box}.mono{font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.nav-link{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;padding:10px 13px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;border-radius:9px;white-space:nowrap}.nav-link:hover{color:var(--text);background:var(--surface-raised)}.nav-link.active{background:#1b2824;color:var(--mint)}.focusable:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--mint);outline-offset:3px}.panel{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px}.stat-separator:not(:last-child){border-right:1px solid var(--line);padding-right:26px;margin-right:26px}.stop-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(250px,1.8fr) minmax(108px,.7fr) minmax(126px,.78fr) minmax(90px,.56fr) minmax(108px,.7fr);align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:15px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-soft);position:relative;transition:background .16s ease}.stop-row:hover{background:#161c1a}.stop-row.selected{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(76,224,188,.1),rgba(76,224,188,.035));box-shadow:inset 2px 0 var(--mint)}.stop-row:last-child{border-bottom:0}.stop-number{width:29px;height:29px;border:1px solid #38584f;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--mint);background:#12201c;font:11px 'DM Mono',monospace;flex:none}.stop-row.selected .stop-number{background:var(--mint);color:#08221a;border-color:var(--mint)}.route-track{position:absolute;left:28px;top:43px;bottom:-17px;width:1px;background:#38584f}.stop-row:last-child .route-track{display:none}.severity{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.025em}.severity-dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block}.risk-red{color:var(--red)}.risk-red .severity-dot{background:var(--red)}.risk-amber{color:var(--amber)}.risk-amber .severity-dot{background:var(--amber)}.risk-mint{color:var(--mint)}.risk-mint .severity-dot{background:var(--mint)}.risk-unknown{color:var(--muted)}.risk-unknown .severity-dot{background:#75817c}.tiny-label{color:var(--quiet);font-size:11px;line-height:1.3}.map-frame{height:336px;position:relative;background:#151b19;border-radius:0 0 13px 13px;overflow:hidden}.map-frame #tempo-map{height:100%;width:100%;display:block;background:#151b19;transform-origin:50% 50%;transition:transform .16s ease}.map-stop{cursor:pointer;outline:none}.map-stop:hover circle,.map-stop:focus-visible circle,.map-stop.selected circle{stroke:#f5f7f6;stroke-width:3}.map-stop.selected:not(.is-current) circle{fill:#ff7180;stroke:#663039}.map-stop.selected:not(.is-current) text{fill:#2a0e12}.map-stop.selected rect{stroke:#f5f7f6}.map-stop:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #4ce0bc;outline-offset:4px}.map-zoom-fallback{position:absolute;z-index:450;top:12px;right:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #36403c}.map-zoom-fallback button{width:32px;height:32px;background:#151b19;border:0;color:#e8efeb}.map-zoom-fallback button+button{border-top:1px solid #36403c}.legend-dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block}.alert-line{display:grid;grid-template-columns:10px 1fr auto;gap:11px;align-items:start;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-soft)}.alert-line:last-child{border-bottom:0}.chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#151a19;border-radius:999px;padding:7px 11px;color:#b6c0bb;font-size:12px}.chip.selected-chip{border-color:#438d78;background:#132822;color:var(--mint)}\n@media(max-width:900px){.tempo-head{padding:0 20px!important;gap:8px!important}.tempo-head>div:first-child{gap:12px!important}.tempo-head>div:last-child button{display:none}.tempo-nav{gap:0!important}.nav-link{padding:8px 9px;font-size:12px}.nav-link i{display:none}.mobile-map-link{display:inline-flex!important}.tempo-body{padding:24px 20px!important}.tempo-columns{grid-template-columns:1fr!important}.right-rail{order:2}.left-workspace{order:1}.stop-row{grid-template-columns:minmax(210px,1.6fr) minmax(84px,.7fr) minmax(96px,.75fr);gap:8px}.stop-row .actual-column,.stop-row .tsb-column{display:none}.ledger-head{grid-template-columns:minmax(210px,1.6fr) minmax(84px,.7fr) minmax(96px,.75fr)!important}.map-frame{height:300px}}\n@media(max-width:620px){.tempo-head{position:relative;height:auto!important;min-height:82px;padding:12px 14px!important;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px!important}.tempo-head>div:first-child{width:100%;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px!important;padding-right:0}.tempo-head>div:last-child{position:absolute;right:14px;top:12px}.tempo-nav{order:3;width:100%;overflow-x:auto;padding-top:4px}.nav-link{font-size:12px;padding:8px 9px}.tempo-body{padding:18px 14px!important}.page-title-row{align-items:flex-start!important;flex-direction:column}.summary-stats{gap:0!important;justify-content:space-between}.stat-separator:not(:last-child){padding-right:12px;margin-right:12px}.summary-value{font-size:17px!important}.stop-row{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto!important;padding:13px 8px!important;gap:7px}.stop-row .eta-column{grid-column:2;grid-row:1}.stop-row .risk-column{grid-column:1 / -1;margin-left:37px}.ledger-head{display:none!important}.map-frame{height:260px}.right-rail{order:3}}\n</style>\n<div class=\"tempo\" data-kid=\"1\" data-name=\"operations dashboard app shell\">\n    <header class=\"tempo-head flex h-[72px] items-center justify-between border-b border-[var(--line)] px-10\" data-kid=\"1-1\" data-name=\"app top bar\">\n        <div class=\"flex min-w-0 items-center gap-9\" data-kid=\"1-1-1\" data-name=\"header left group with brand and navigation\">\n            <a aria-label=\"T.E.M.P.O. home\" class=\"flex items-center gap-3 no-underline text-[var(--text)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"brand logo link to dashboard\" href=\"#dashboard\">\n                <span class=\"grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-[11px] bg-[var(--mint)] text-[18px] font-bold text-[#092018]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"brand tile logo\">\n                    T\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"text-[16px] font-bold tracking-[-.03em]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"brand wordmark text\">\n                    T.E.M.P.O.\n                </span>\n            </a>\n            <nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\" class=\"tempo-nav flex items-center gap-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"main navigation bar\">\n                <a aria-current=\"page\" class=\"nav-link active focusable\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"dashboard nav link (active)\" href=\"#dashboard\">\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-layout-dashboard text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"dashboard nav icon\" style=\"width:18px;height:18px;color:currentColor\">\n                    </i>\n                    Dashboard\n                </a>\n                <a class=\"nav-link focusable\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"routes nav link\" href=\"#routes\">\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-route text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"routes nav icon\" style=\"width:18px;height:18px;color:currentColor\">\n                    </i>\n                    Routes\n                </a>\n                <a class=\"nav-link focusable\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-3\" data-name=\"alerts nav link\" href=\"#alerts\">\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-alert-triangle text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"alerts nav icon\" style=\"width:18px;height:18px;color:currentColor\">\n                    </i>\n                    Alerts\n                </a>\n                <a class=\"nav-link focusable\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-4\" data-name=\"analytics nav link\" href=\"#analytics\">\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-chart-bar text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"analytics nav icon\" style=\"width:18px;height:18px;color:currentColor\">\n                    </i>\n                    Analytics\n                </a>\n            </nav>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-2\" data-name=\"header right controls group\">\n            <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[#5b4927] bg-[#241d12] px-3 py-[7px] text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#f0c66c]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"demo scenario badge\">\n                <span class=\"h-[7px] w-[7px] rounded-full bg-[var(--amber)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"demo badge indicator dot\">\n                </span>\n                Demo scenario · not live\n            </span>\n            <button aria-label=\"More options\" class=\"focusable grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-full border border-[var(--line)] bg-[var(--surface)] text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"more options menu button\">\n                <i class=\"ti ti-dots text-[19px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"more options dots icon\" style=\"width:20px;height:20px;color:currentColor\">\n                </i>\n            </button>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n    <main class=\"tempo-body mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-10 pb-12 pt-8\" data-kid=\"1-2\" data-name=\"main dashboard content\">\n        <div class=\"page-title-row mb-6 flex items-end justify-between gap-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-1\" data-name=\"page title row\">\n            <div data-kid=\"1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"page heading and subtitle\">\n                <h1 class=\"m-0 text-[27px] font-semibold tracking-[-.04em] text-[var(--text)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"page heading text\">\n                    Operations dashboard\n                </h1>\n                <p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[14px] text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"page subtitle text\">\n                    Collection round · thermal safety and dispatch overview\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[12px] text-[var(--quiet)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"demo disclaimer note\">\n                <i class=\"ti ti-info-circle text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"info circle icon\" style=\"width:17px;height:17px;color:currentColor\">\n                </i>\n                Illustrative sample values · no live observations\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <section aria-label=\"Fleet summary\" class=\"summary-stats mb-7 flex flex-wrap items-center rounded-[12px] border border-[var(--line)] bg-[var(--surface)] px-6 py-[17px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2\" data-name=\"fleet summary stats bar\">\n            <div class=\"stat-separator min-w-[156px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"active vehicles stat block\">\n                <div class=\"tiny-label mb-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"active vehicles label\">\n                    Active vehicles\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"summary-value flex items-baseline gap-2 text-[22px] font-semibold tracking-[-.03em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"active vehicles value row\">\n                    <span class=\"mono\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"active vehicles count number\">\n                        2\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"mono text-[13px] font-normal text-[var(--quiet)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"total vehicles denominator\">\n                        / 3\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"text-[12px] font-medium text-[var(--mint)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-3\" data-name=\"on round status label\">\n                        on round\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"stat-separator min-w-[184px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"volume in transit stat block\">\n                <div class=\"tiny-label mb-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"volume in transit label\">\n                    Volume in transit\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"summary-value flex items-baseline gap-2 text-[22px] font-semibold tracking-[-.03em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"volume in transit value row\">\n                    <span class=\"mono\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"volume litres number\">\n                        4,820\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"text-[13px] font-medium text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"volume unit label\">\n                        L\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"min-w-[170px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"bulk milk coolers stat block\">\n                <div class=\"tiny-label mb-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"bulk coolers label\">\n                    Bulk milk coolers\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"summary-value flex items-baseline gap-2 text-[22px] font-semibold tracking-[-.03em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"bulk coolers value row\">\n                    <span class=\"mono text-[var(--mint)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"bulk coolers online count\">\n                        1\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"mono text-[13px] font-normal text-[var(--quiet)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"bulk coolers total denominator\">\n                        / 1\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[12px] font-medium text-[var(--mint)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-3\" data-name=\"bulk coolers online status badge\">\n                        <span class=\"h-[6px] w-[6px] rounded-full bg-[var(--mint)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-3-1\" data-name=\"online status indicator dot\">\n                        </span>\n                        online\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"ml-auto flex items-center gap-2 border-l border-[var(--line)] pl-6 text-[12px] text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4\" data-name=\"last retrieval status note\">\n                <i class=\"ti ti-database-off text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"database off icon\" style=\"width:17px;height:17px;color:var(--amber)\">\n                </i>\n                Last successful retrieval: unavailable in demo\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <div class=\"tempo-columns grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.72fr)_minmax(360px,.9fr)] items-start gap-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-3\" data-name=\"two-column dashboard layout\">\n            <section aria-labelledby=\"round-title\" class=\"left-workspace panel min-w-0 overflow-hidden\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"collection round panel\">\n                <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-[var(--line)] px-5 py-[17px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"round panel header row\">\n                    <div data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"round panel title and description\">\n                        <h2 class=\"m-0 text-[16px] font-semibold tracking-[-.015em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"round panel title false\" id=\"round-title\">\n                            Collection round\n                        </h2>\n                        <p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[12px] text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"round panel subtitle text\">\n                            Next stops · estimated travel durations, not clock times\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-2\" data-name=\"vehicle filter and map controls group\">\n                        <label class=\"sr-only\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"selected vehicle field label (sr-only)\" for=\"vehicle-select\">\n                            Selected vehicle\n                        </label>\n                        <select class=\"focusable rounded-[9px] border border-[var(--line)] bg-[var(--surface-raised)] px-3 py-[9px] text-[13px] font-medium text-[var(--text)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"selected vehicle dropdown\" id=\"vehicle-select\">\n                            <option data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"vehicle option: Tanker 01\">\n                                Tanker 01 · selected\n                            </option>\n                            <option data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"vehicle option: Tanker 02\">\n                                Tanker 02\n                            </option>\n                            <option data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"vehicle option: All vehicles\">\n                                All vehicles\n                            </option>\n                        </select>\n                        <button class=\"mobile-map-link focusable hidden items-center gap-1.5 rounded-[9px] border border-[#38584f] bg-[#13231f] px-3 py-[9px] text-[12px] font-semibold text-[var(--mint)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-2-3\" data-name=\"mobile view map button\" onclick=\"document.getElementById('route-map-panel').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'})\">\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-map-pin text-[15px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"map pin icon\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;color:currentColor\">\n                            </i>\n                            View map\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-5 py-3 text-[12px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"round ledger context bar\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"selection status indicator row\">\n                        <span class=\"h-[7px] w-[7px] rounded-full bg-[var(--mint)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"selection status dot\">\n                        </span>\n                        Vehicle selected on map and ledger\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mono text-[var(--quiet)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-2\" data-name=\"stop count and demo tag\">\n                        4 stops · DEMO\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"ledger-head grid grid-cols-[minmax(250px,1.8fr)_minmax(108px,.7fr)_minmax(126px,.78fr)_minmax(90px,.56fr)_minmax(108px,.7fr)] gap-[10px] border-y border-[var(--line-soft)] bg-[var(--surface-deep)] px-[14px] py-[10px] text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.08em] text-[var(--quiet)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3\" data-name=\"ledger column header row\">\n                    <div data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-1\" data-name=\"collection point column header\">\n                        Village / collection point\n                    </div>\n                    <div data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-2\" data-name=\"ETA column header\">\n                        ETA · demo\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"actual-column\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-3\" data-name=\"actual arrival column header\">\n                        Actual arrival\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"tsb-column\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-4\" data-name=\"TSB column header\">\n                        TSB\n                    </div>\n                    <div data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-3-5\" data-name=\"thermal risk column header\">\n                        Thermal risk\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-4\" data-name=\"stop list container\" id=\"stop-list\">\n                    <button aria-pressed=\"true\" class=\"stop-row selected focusable w-full text-left\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-4-1\" data-name=\"stop row: selected next stop\" data-stop=\"s1\" type=\"button\">\n                        <div class=\"flex min-w-0 items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-4-1-1\" data-name=\"stop identity group\">\n                            <span class=\"relative\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-4-1-1-1\" data-name=\"stop number with route track wrapper\">\n                                <span class=\"stop-number\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-4-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"stop number badge\">\n                                    01\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"route-track\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-4-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"route track connector line\">\n                                </span>\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"min-w-0\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-4-1-1-2\" data-name=\"stop name and vehicle group\">\n                                <span class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-4-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"stop name row with badge\">\n                                    <strong class=\"truncate text-[14px] font-semibold text-[var(--text)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-4-1-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"stop name text\">\n                                        Village collection center A\n                                    </strong>\n                                    <span class=\"rounded-[5px] border border-[#514125] bg-[#282014] px-[6px] py-[2px] text-[10px] font-bold text-[var(--amber)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-4-1-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"next stop badge\">\n                                        NEXT STOP\n                                    </span>\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"mt-1 block text-[12px] text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-4-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"stop vehicle and sample type text\">\n                                    Tanker 01\n                                    <span class=\"px-1 text-[var(--quiet)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-4-1-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"vehicle and type separator\">\n                                        ·\n                                    </span>\n                                    VCC sample\n                                </span>\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"eta-column\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-4-1-2\" data-name=\"stop ETA cell\">\n                            <div class=\"mono text-[13px] font-medium text-[var(--text)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-4-1-2-1\" data-name=\"stop ETA value\">\n                                ~14 min\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"tiny-label mt-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-4-1-2-2\" data-name=\"stop ETA label\">\n                                route estimate\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"actual-column\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-4-1-3\" data-name=\"stop actual arrival cell\">\n                            <div class=\"text-[13px] text-[var(--quiet)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-4-1-3-1\" data-name=\"actual arrival value\">\n                                Not reached\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"tiny-label mt-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-4-1-3-2\" data-name=\"actual arrival label\">\n                                no actual arrival\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"tsb-column\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-