efinitions legend text\">\n                            <strong data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-4-1-1\" data-name=\"estimated arrival legend term\">\n                                Est.\n                            </strong>\n                            is a planned arrival ·\n                            <strong data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-4-1-2\" data-name=\"actual arrival legend term\">\n                                Actual\n                            </strong>\n                            is recorded on arrival.\n                        </span>\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-4-2\" data-name=\"not collected legend note\">\n                            “Not collected” means no sample is available yet.\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <section aria-label=\"Simulated route optimization preview\" class=\"preview-panel\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2\" data-name=\"optimization preview panel\">\n                    <div class=\"preview-head\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1\" data-name=\"preview panel heading\">\n                        <h2 class=\"preview-title\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"preview title\">\n                            Optimization preview · simulated\n                        </h2>\n                        <span class=\"simulated-chip\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"simulated scenario chip\">\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-flask-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"flask simulated icon\">\n                            </i>\n                            NOT APPLIED\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"preview-path\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2\" data-name=\"preview suggested path\">\n                        <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-arrows-sort\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"reorder arrows icon\">\n                        </i>\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"preview path text group\">\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"preview path instruction\">\n                                Move VCC-013 ahead of the lower-risk stop.\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"preview-reason\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"preview path reasoning note\">\n                                Reason: prioritize the open stop with the shortest modeled thermal buffer.\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"preview-metrics\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-3\" data-name=\"preview metrics row\">\n                        <div class=\"preview-metric\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"time saved metric\">\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"time saved label\">\n                                Estimated time saved\n                            </span>\n                            <strong data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"time saved value\">\n                                12 min\n                            </strong>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"preview-metric\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"risk reduction metric\">\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"risk reduction label\">\n                                Modeled risk reduction\n                            </span>\n                            <strong data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"risk reduction value\">\n                                18%\n                            </strong>\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"preview-not-applied\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-3-3\" data-name=\"not applied disclaimer\">\n                            Scenario values only · review before applying\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n            </section>\n            <aside aria-label=\"Route map and model context\" class=\"context-column\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2\" data-name=\"map and model context column\">\n                <section class=\"map-panel\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"route map panel\">\n                    <div class=\"map-head\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"map panel header\">\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"map header text group\">\n                            <h2 data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"map title\">\n                                Route context\n                            </h2>\n                            <p class=\"panel-subtitle\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"map subtitle (vehicle)\">\n                                Selected vehicle · Tanker 2\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"map-zoom\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"map zoom indicator\">\n                            Regional view\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div aria-label=\"Schematic route map showing completed stop 1, next warning stop 2, critical stop 3 and BMC destination\" class=\"map-visual\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-2\" data-name=\"schematic route map area\" role=\"img\">\n                        <span class=\"map-label anand\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"route map origin label\">\n                            Collection area\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"map-label route-end\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"route map destination label\">\n                            BMC-001\n                        </span>\n                        <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"route-map-svg\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-2-3\" data-name=\"route path SVG drawing\" preserveaspectratio=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 330 205\">\n                            <path d=\"M 35 154 C 65 142, 74 97, 112 94 S 154 112, 179 78 S 226 70, 245 51 S 273 52, 298 35\" fill=\"none\" opacity=\".72\" stroke=\"#5a6a61\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 6\" stroke-width=\"3\">\n                            </path>\n                            <path d=\"M 35 154 C 65 142, 74 97, 112 94\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#58dfbb\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"3.5\">\n                            </path>\n                            <path d=\"M 112 94 C 154 112, 179 78, 205 69\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f0c35a\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"3.5\">\n                            </path>\n                            <path d=\"M 205 69 C 226 70, 245 51, 266 48\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ff7180\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"3.5\">\n                            </path>\n                            <circle cx=\"35\" cy=\"154\" fill=\"#58dfbb\" r=\"8\" stroke=\"#101714\" stroke-width=\"4\">\n                            </circle>\n                            <text fill=\"#dce3de\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10\" x=\"20\" y=\"176\">\n                                01\n                            </text>\n                            <circle cx=\"112\" cy=\"94\" fill=\"#f0c35a\" r=\"10\" stroke=\"#101714\" stroke-width=\"4\">\n                            </circle>\n                            <circle cx=\"112\" cy=\"94\" fill=\"#101714\" r=\"3\">\n                            </circle>\n                            <text fill=\"#f0c35a\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10\" x=\"101\" y=\"76\">\n                                02\n                            </text>\n                            <circle cx=\"205\" cy=\"69\" fill=\"#ff7180\" r=\"8\" stroke=\"#101714\" stroke-width=\"4\">\n                            </circle>\n                            <text fill=\"#ff7180\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"10\" x=\"194\" y=\"51\">\n                                03\n                            </text>\n                            <rect fill=\"#d7e1da\" height=\"15\" rx=\"3\" stroke=\"#101714\" stroke-width=\"3\" width=\"15\" x=\"289\" y=\"26\">\n                            </rect>\n                            <text fill=\"#dce3de\" font-family=\"IBM Plex Mono\" font-size=\"9\" x=\"281\" y=\"57\">\n                                BMC\n                            </text>\n                        </svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"map-key\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-3\" data-name=\"map legend key\">\n                        <span class=\"map-key-item\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"completed legend item\">\n                            <i class=\"key-marker\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"completed legend marker\">\n                            </i>\n                            Completed\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"map-key-item\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-3-2\" data-name=\"next stop legend item\">\n                            <i class=\"key-marker next\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"next stop legend marker\">\n                            </i>\n                            Next stop\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"map-key-item\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-3-3\" data-name=\"critical stop legend item\">\n                            <i class=\"key-marker critical\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-3-3-1\" data-name=\"critical stop legend marker\">\n                            </i>\n                            Critical stop\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"map-key-item\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-3-4\" data-name=\"BMC legend item\">\n                            <i class=\"key-marker bmc\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-3-4-1\" data-name=\"BMC legend marker\">\n                            </i>\n                            BMC\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"context-summary\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-4\" data-name=\"route readout summary\">\n                        <h3 data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-4-1\" data-name=\"route readout heading\">\n                            Route readout\n                        </h3>\n                        <div class=\"context-line\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-4-2\" data-name=\"next stop context row\">\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-4-2-1\" data-name=\"next stop context label\">\n                                Next stop\n                            </span>\n                            <strong data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-4-2-2\" data-name=\"next stop context value\">\n                                VCC-010\n                            </strong>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"context-line\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-4-3\" data-name=\"modeled tsb context row\">\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-4-3-1\" data-name=\"modeled tsb context label\">\n                                Modeled TSB\n                            </span>\n                            <strong data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-4-3-2\" data-name=\"modeled tsb context value\" style=\"color:var(--warning)\">\n                                1.4 h · warning\n                            </strong>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"context-line\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-4-4\" data-name=\"current load context row\">\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-4-4-1\" data-name=\"current load context label\">\n                                Current load\n                            </span>\n                            <strong data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-1-4-4-2\" data-name=\"current load context value\">\n                                4,820 L\n                            </strong>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n                <section class=\"model-note\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"thermal risk model note panel\">\n                    <h3 data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"model note title\">\n                        Thermal risk bands\n                    </h3>\n                    <p data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-2-2\" data-name=\"model note description\">\n                        TSB is an estimated quality-limit buffer. The documented thresholds are model assumptions, not verified safety guarantees.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"model-bands\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-2-3\" data-name=\"thermal risk bands legend\">\n                        <span class=\"band\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"critical band legend item\">\n                            <i class=\"risk-dot critical\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"critical band risk dot\">\n                            </i>\n                            <0.5 h critical\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"band\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"warning band legend item\">\n                            <i class=\"risk-dot warning\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"warning band risk dot\">\n                            </i>\n                            0.5–2.5 h warning\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"band\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-2-3-3\" data-name=\"buffer band legend item\">\n                            <i class=\"risk-dot\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-2-3-3-1\" data-name=\"buffer band risk dot\">\n                            </i>\n                            >2.5 h buffer\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"model-caption\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-2-2-4\" data-name=\"model caption disclaimer\">\n                        Values shown are part of this demo scenario, not live field readings.\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n            </aside>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n</div>\n",
      "comments": [],
